hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1782","[AI-translation] Jubair bin Mutim (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko Maghrib mein Toor padhtey huey suna. Phir jab Aap is aayat tak pahunchay: (Kya wo baghair kisi cheez key paida kiye gaey hain ya wo paida karney waley hain? Kya unhon-ne aasmaan aur zameen paida kiye hain? Balke wo yaqeen nahi rakhtey. Kya unkey paas tumhaarey Rab key khazaanay hain ya wo nighebaan hain). Unhon-ne kaha: Mera dil udney laga. (Bukhari: 4854). Allah Taala ka qaul: (Kya tum ne Laat aur Uzza ko dekha)."
